              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "text_MEY89A": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.description",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>At Kahu, our journey began beneath the waves. As passionate scuba divers, we’ve spent countless hours exploring the breathtaking beauty of our oceans. Having spent a lot of time on the boat we realized the need for a lightweight, quick dry towel —we were tired of carrying around the heavy and bulky ones on our trips. Driven by this need, we set out to create something truly special: a versatile, beautifully designed, marine wonders-inspired poncho, one that could serve not just as a dry towel, but<br/>also as a cover-up during surface intervals and a convenient way to change clothes on the go. With sustainability top of mind, our ponchos are made from suede microfiber, crafted from recycled plastic bottles and minimized packaging materials. We wanted to design a product that could be functional, comfortable, and, above all, eco-friendly. A product that’s not just great for ocean lovers, but great for the planet too.</p><p><br/>At Kahu, we believe in giving back. That’s why we commit 10% of our profits towards marine conservation efforts, because protecting what we love is more than just a mission—it’s a responsibility. The name \"Kahu,\" drawn from Hawaiian culture, means “protector” or “guardian,” and that’s what we aspire to be: guardians of the ocean and its wonders. With every poncho, we are contributing to a bigger picture—one where we protect the oceans we cherish and ensure their beauty is preserved for future generations. Join us on our journey to create a more sustainable, compassionate, and conscious world for ocean lovers, water activity enthusiasts, and beyond.</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "normal",
                "alignment": "left",
                "type_preset": "custom",
                "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                "font_size": "1rem",
                "line_height": "normal",
                "letter_spacing": "normal",
                "case": "none",
                "wrap": "balance",
                "text_color": "",
                "background": false,
                "background_color": "#00000026",
                "corner_radius": 0,
                "padding-block-start": 25,
                "padding-block-end": 0,
                "padding-inline-start": 20,
                "padding-inline-end": 20
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
